              "isInner": false,
              "settings": {
                "tabs": [
                  {
                    "_id": "972a846",
                    "tab_title": "Is VAT on restaurant food 20%?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>Food eaten on your premises is standard-rated at 20%. Hot takeaway food is also 20%. Most cold takeaway food, such as a sandwich to go, is zero-rated. Alcohol and soft drinks are 20% whether eaten in or taken away.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "6c03119",
                    "tab_title": "What is a good GP% for a restaurant?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>Many UK restaurants aim for a food gross profit of around 65–70% and a drinks gross profit of 70% or more. The right target depends on your menu, pricing and concept.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "0822e8f",
                    "tab_title": "What is prime cost?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>Prime cost is your food and drink costs plus your labour costs. Many hospitality businesses aim to keep it under 60–65% of sales, so there is enough left for rent, bills and profit.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "07a0ca6",
                    "tab_title": "How much does it cost to employ someone in the UK in 2026/27?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>On top of gross pay, you pay employer National Insurance at 15% on earnings over £5,000 a year, plus at least 3% employer pension on qualifying earnings. Many small employers can claim Employment Allowance of up to £10,500 a year against their employer NI.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "17fc695",
                    "tab_title": "Are these calculators tax advice?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>No. They give estimates for guidance. Speak to an F&amp;A hospitality accountant for advice on your own figures.</p>"
                  }
                ],
                "_css_classes": "fa-faq",
                "title_color": "#123560",
                "tab_active_color": "#E96C20",
